# oc-sim scenario v1
# MELODY's two-field rows (journal/D-047): launched as in melody.scn, the left
# encoder walks five fields to INVERT, on the CHORD row beside TRIAD, and the
# right encoder turns it up: only that field is boxed, its arrow pointing up
# (the lower tone raised an octave); KEY shows C and MAJOR side by side.
