70  button down up
90  button down down
100 button down up
110 button down down
120 button down up
130 button down down
140 button down up
150 button down down
160 button down up
170 button down down
180 button down up
190 button down down
200 button down up
220 button right down
226 button right up
300 encoder 1 +5
350 encoder 2 +1
